{"name":"Moussaka","hex":"#6d2a13","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"moussaka","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dish consisting of layers of minced lamb or beef, sliced aubergine (eggplant) or potatoes, tomatoes and béchamel sauce, baked in the oven."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/moussaka"}],"entries":[{"title":"Moussaka","blocks":[{"text":"Moussaka is an aubergine (eggplant)- or potato-based dish, often including ground meat, which is common in the Balkans and the Middle East, with many local and regional variations."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/MussakasMeMelitsanesKePatates01.JPG/330px-MussakasMeMelitsanesKePatates01.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moussaka","wikidata":"Q206918"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Moussaka_and_Greek_Salad_at_a_taverna_in_Greece.jpg/500px-Moussaka_and_Greek_Salad_at_a_taverna_in_Greece.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Moussaka_and_Greek_Salad_at_a_taverna_in_Greece.jpg/1280px-Moussaka_and_Greek_Salad_at_a_taverna_in_Greece.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Moussaka_and_Greek_Salad_at_a_taverna_in_Greece.jpg/500px-Moussaka_and_Greek_Salad_at_a_taverna_in_Greece.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Moussaka and Greek salad at a taverna in Greece","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMoussaka_and_Greek_Salad_at_a_taverna_in_Greece.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/%D0%9C%D1%83%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B0_%D0%BE%D0%B4_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%B8_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-%D0%9C%D1%83%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B0_%D0%BE